#: kcmlaunch.cpp:48
msgid "Busy Cursor"
msgstr "Besig Plekaanduier"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:50
msgid ""
"<h1>Busy Cursor</h1>\n"
"KDE offers a busy cursor for application startup notification.\n"
"To enable the busy cursor, check 'Enable busy cursor'.\n"
"To have the cursor blinking, check 'Enable blinking' below.\n"
"It may occur, that some applications are not aware of this startup\n"
"notification. In this case, the cursor stops blinking after the time\n"
"given in the section 'Startup indication timeout'"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Besig Plekaanduier</h1>\n"
"Kde bied 'n Besig Plekaanduier vir aansoek opstart inkennisstelling.\n"
"Na aktiveer die Besig Plekaanduier, bevestig 'aktiveer Besig Plekaanduier'.\n"
"Na het die Plekaanduier flikkerende, bevestig 'aktiveer flikkerende' onder.\n"
"Dit dalk mag gebeur, wat sommige programme word nie bewus van hierdie "
"opstart\n"
"inkennisstelling. in hierdie kas, die Plekaanduier stop flikkerende na die "
"tyd\n"
"gegewe in die seksie 'opstart indikasie timeout'"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:68
msgid "&Enable busy cursor"
msgstr "Aktiveer besig plekaanduier"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:78
msgid "Enable &blinking"
msgstr "Aktiveer flikkerende"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:84
msgid "&Startup indication timeout:"
msgstr "Opstart indikasie tydverstreke:"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:88 kcmlaunch.cpp:125
msgid " sec"
msgstr " sek"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:95
msgid "Taskbar Notification"
msgstr "Kasbar Inkennisstelling"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:96
msgid ""
"<H1>Taskbar Notification</H1>\n"
"You can enable a second method of startup notification which is\n"
"used by the taskbar where a button with a rotating hourglass appears,\n"
"symbolizing that your started application is loading.\n"
"It may occur, that some applications are not aware of this startup\n"
"notification. In this case, the button disappears after the time\n"
"given in the section 'Startup indication timeout'"
msgstr ""

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:114
msgid "Enable &taskbar notification"
msgstr "Aktiveer kasbar inkennisstelling"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:121
msgid "Startup &indication timeout:"
msgstr "Opstart indikasie tydverstreke:"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:283
msgid "<h1>Launch</h1> You can configure the application-launch feedback here."
msgstr "<h1>Lanseer</h1> Jy kan konfigureer die application-Lanseer terugvoer hier."
